# TanStack Router generated route tree. Committed (not ignored) so `tsc`/CI work
# on a fresh checkout — the plugin only generates it during a vite run, but the
# typecheck + build steps invoke `tsc` first. The vite plugin keeps it fresh on
# every dev/build. (Same "commit generated output" stance as packages/api-client.)

